The Vauxhall Zafira Tourer 'Exclusiv' trim was primarily available on the pre-facelift model (2011-2016). It was positioned above the entry-level 'ES' trim. I will use data for the 2015 model year as the "most recent version applicable" for this trim.

- **price_usd**: Used prices for 2015 Vauxhall Zafira Tourer Exclusiv models in the UK range from around £2,290 to £6,750. Converting £4,500 (a mid-range price) to USD (approx 1.2 USD/GBP) is $5,400. This is well below the market average of $52,000. Score: +1.00.
